/span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 169, 0);\">\n                   特别建议：养豆3周左右会很柑橘绿茶，从春节前第一次打样到年终总结的批次，最近发现越来越好喝，之前豆子新鲜时会很容易出现谷物煎茶甜坚果，现在煎茶那种炒谷物的香气变为绿茶的清新，本身的类似老品种波旁和铁皮卡的那种柔和的柑橘酸甜更为饱满了，甚至还会有一些日晒的发酵感出来，苦感很弱很容易消逝～\n                  </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TAWWsbN3mr1FLZttGiavtib4yTF4pjQYW9PP6RnwcvH1mibJmJicBoSGVdyDibqR46cJ9NjN0Rq3Cflmg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n                   昆迪纳马卡位于地图的中部紫色的部分\n                  </span>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                    关于摩卡品种‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n                   </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n                   它是波旁品种的自然突变品种，矮小的树型，咖啡果粒也非常小，咖啡豆像小绿豆一样大小，而且很圆，最早在也门发现，所以得名于也门的摩卡港，后来被引种到法属的留尼旺岛，\n                  </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n                   目前在也门和中南美洲有零星种植。\n                  </span>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                    关于使命庄园\n                   </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                    Misiones咖啡庄园成立于1899年，位于哥伦中部的昆迪纳马卡产区，左边与Caldas，Tolima和Quindo接壤；庄园\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n                    占地约600公顷。咖啡是庄园的核心产业之一，除此之外还有畜牧业和其他种植业。\n                   </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RbTS6wFknr3vlSCEoiaicOkYcz5tLCXnDeVjjw4cbuC1KLSmj7WDiaNL5OqEzXRQW6Yoy9rH1APN2hw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 382px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                    庄园每年可生产约600吨咖啡豆，二战前后期，数百头骡子将咖啡生豆运往马格达莱纳港口，从那里被运输到德国、英国和美国等主流消费市场。因此，Misiones庄园也是哥伦比亚为数不多的仍然有从苏格兰格拉斯哥进口的完好古早机械的庄园之一。这些机器经过改造，成为咖啡学者和爱好者的历史博物馆。\n                   </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RbTS6wFknr3vlSCEoiaicOkYsnibcVD6X6trzs9ibsicZZlzO7CveFCEpiaWal3cv5rMsT2soBRicQNf7yg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 383px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                    使命庄园的古早机械\n                   </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                    使命庄园特别注意咖啡的处理过程。采摘工们仔细地一颗一颗采摘咖啡鲜果，并用骡子将咖啡果从偏远的山中运送到庄园的处理站，之后用干净的山泉水清洗，再去除表面水分。豆子处理完成后会转移到不同的器具或晾晒房中进行干燥，最重要的是保护它们的胚芽不会损坏。\n                   </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RbTS6wFknr3vlSCEoiaicOkYA3Jo15hZyccleTRLz9a0amsxYcmgLY7Gb0xYkrX2vmd5KzAfv4Vvzg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 385px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                    庄园的堆肥站使用咖啡果皮来进行堆肥，在喜糖的微生物的帮助下，生产营养丰富的肥料。晾晒干的豆子会被运送到一个脱壳厂，在那里去除它们的羊皮纸或外壳，并根据目数、颜色和密度进行筛选。成品的生豆将装在带有GrainPro的麻袋中保存，然后运到仓库发往世界各地。\n                   </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RbTS6wFknr3vlSCEoiaicOkYp7nFdoFOz5iacNZT8nCVOSCDxaDk5ctFW0W1eXEgiahaIDOSBGf3jasQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 323px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                    庄园使用咖啡果皮进行堆肥\n                   </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RbTS6wFknr3vlSCEoiaicOkYskseT0xRdc9dyjb12sdYRDnFiaPygSfWM0Rkd2jc8WBp53O6WsicPmNQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 323px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n                   更多咖啡豆选购，请关注淘宝店铺哦～\n                  </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n                   公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n                  </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n                   客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n                  </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
